  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/idursun/jjui/tarball/v0.10.14",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/idursun/jjui/zipball/v0.10.14",
  "body": "A small release to wrap up the v0.10 series before moving on to [v0.11](https://github.com/idursun/jjui/discussions/781).\r\n\r\nYou can now resize the preview from Lua, abandon now works the same way as `jj abandon`, and there are a few bookmark fixes.\r\n\r\n## Improvements\r\n\r\n### Set the preview size from Lua\r\n\r\n`ui.preview` has two new functions: `set_size(percent)` sets how much space the preview takes, and `size()` returns the current size. `set_size` opens the preview if it is hidden and keeps focus on the revisions list. It also accepts `100`, which lets the preview take the full screen. Expanding the preview or dragging the separator still stops before that point.\r\n\r\nFor example, this binds `alt+p` to toggle a full-screen preview:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[[actions]]\r\nname = \"toggle preview full size\"\r\nlua = '''\r\nif jjui.ui.preview.size() == 100 then\r\n  jjui.ui.preview.set_size(50)\r\nelse\r\n  jjui.ui.preview.set_size(100)\r\nend\r\n'''\r\nkey = \"alt+p\"\r\nscope = \"ui\"\r\ndesc = \"Toggle preview full size\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n(#776)\r\n\r\n### Wider help view\r\n\r\nThe help view can now grow to 120 columns, up from 90. Entries no longer have `(when ...)` conditions appended to them. Bindings that don't apply to the current selection are still struck through.\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n\r\n### Rename bookmarks with spaces\r\n\r\nThe bookmark pane's rename prompt now replaces spaces with hyphens, the same way the set bookmark prompt does. Before, a name with spaces made `jj bookmark rename` fail.\r\n\r\n(#779)\r\n\r\n### Filter bookmark items by the exact remote\r\n\r\nWhen you pick a remote in the bookmarks menu, it now lists only that remote's track/untrack items. Before, it matched remote names as substrings, so with remotes `up` and `upstream`, picking `up` also listed `track 'feature@upstream'`.\r\n\r\n(#787)\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n### Abandon now deletes bookmarks\r\n\r\nAbandon now behaves like `jj abandon` and deletes bookmarks on the abandoned revisions. Before, jjui passed `--retain-bookmarks`, which moved them to the parent. To get the old behaviour back, add this to `config.toml`:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[revisions.abandon]\r\nretain_bookmarks = true\r\n```\r\n\r\n(#783)\r\n\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* fix: Make abandon command behave the same as jj abandon by @dnnr in https://github.com/idursun/jjui/pull/783\r\n* fix(bookmarkpane): replace spaces with hyphens when renaming a bookmark by @aliassar in https://github.com/idursun/jjui/pull/779\r\n* fix(bookmarks): match the selected remote exactly when filtering by @aliassar in https://github.com/idursun/jjui/pull/787\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @dnnr made their first contribution in https://github.com/idursun/jjui/pull/783\r\n* @aliassar made their first contribution in https://github.com/idursun/jjui/pull/779\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/idursun/jjui/compare/v0.10.13...v0.10.14",
